#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:700
#, no-wrap
msgid "Advanced Topics"
msgstr "高级主题"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:703
msgid ""
"This section covers more involved topics such as mail configuration and "
"setting up mail for an entire domain."
msgstr "本节涵盖更多主题，例如邮件配置和为整个域设置邮件服务。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:705
#, no-wrap
msgid "Basic Configuration"
msgstr "基础设定"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:709
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Out of the box, one can send email to external hosts as long as [.filename]#/"
"etc/resolv.conf# is configured or the network has access to a configured DNS "
"server.  To have email delivered to the MTA on the FreeBSD host, do one of "
"the following:"
msgstr ""
"只要配置了 <filename>/etc/resolv.conf</filename> 或可以访问配置好的 "
"<acronym>DNS</acronym> 服务器， 就可以向外部主机发送电子邮件。要将电子邮件传"
"送到 FreeBSD 主机上的 <acronym>MTA</acronym>， 请执行以下操作之一："

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:711
#, fuzzy
msgid "Run a DNS server for the domain."
msgstr "为该域运行 DNS 服务器。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:712
#, fuzzy
msgid "Get mail delivered directly to the FQDN for the machine."
msgstr "让邮件直接投递到该机器的 FQDN。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:716
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "In order to have mail delivered directly to a host, it must have a "
#| "permanent static IP address, not a dynamic IP address. If the system is "
#| "behind a firewall, it must be configured to allow SMTP traffic. To "
#| "receive mail directly at a host, one of these two must be configured:"
msgid ""
"In order to have mail delivered directly to a host, it must have a permanent "
"static IP address, not a dynamic IP address.  If the system is behind a "
"firewall, it must be configured to allow SMTP traffic.  To receive mail "
"directly at a host, one of these two must be configured:"
msgstr ""
"为了让邮件直接投递到主机上，它必须有一个永久的静态IP地址，而不是动态IP地址。"
"如果系统位于防火墙后面，必须配置成允许SMTP流量。要在主机上直接接收邮件，必须"
"启用其中一个配置："

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:718
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Make sure that the lowest-numbered MX record in DNS points to the host's "
"static IP address."
msgstr "确保 DNS 中编号最小的 MX 记录指向主机的静态 IP 地址。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:719
#, fuzzy
msgid "Make sure there is no MX entry in the DNS for the host."
msgstr "确保 DNS 中没有该主机的 MX 记录。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:721
msgid ""
"Either of the above will allow mail to be received directly at the host."
msgstr "这两种方法都能让主机直接接收邮件。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:723
msgid "Try this:"
msgstr "试试这个："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:727
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# hostname\n"
msgstr "# hostname\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:730
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:742
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:760
#, fuzzy
msgid "The output should be similar to the following:"
msgstr "输出应类似于以下内容："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:734
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "example.FreeBSD.org\n"
msgstr "example.FreeBSD.org\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:739
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:757
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# host example.FreeBSD.org\n"
msgstr "# host example.FreeBSD.org\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:746
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "example.FreeBSD.org has address 204.216.27.XX\n"
msgstr "example.FreeBSD.org has address 204.216.27.XX\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:751
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In this example, mail sent directly to mailto:yourlogin@example.FreeBSD."
"org[yourlogin@example.FreeBSD.org] should work without problems, assuming a "
"full-featured MTA is running correctly on `example.FreeBSD.org`.  Note that "
"man:dma[8] does not listen on port 25 for incoming connections and cannot be "
"used in this scenario."
msgstr "在此示例中，直接发送到 mailto:yourlogin@example.FreeBSD.org[yourlogin@example.FreeBSD.org] 的邮件应该可以正常投递，前提是 `example.FreeBSD.org` 上运行的功能齐全的 MTA 正常工作。请注意，man:dma[8] 不会监听端口 25 上的传入连接，因此不能用于此场景。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:753
msgid "For this example:"
msgstr "对这个例子："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:765
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"example.FreeBSD.org has address 204.216.27.XX\n"
"example.FreeBSD.org mail is handled (pri=10) by nevdull.FreeBSD.org\n"
msgstr "example.FreeBSD.org has address 204.216.27.XX\nexample.FreeBSD.org mail is handled (pri=10) by nevdull.FreeBSD.org\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:768
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"All mail sent to `example.FreeBSD.org` will be collected on `nevdull` under "
"the same username instead of being sent directly to the local host."
msgstr "所有发送到 `example.FreeBSD.org` 的邮件都会投递到 `nevdull` 上同名的用户，而不是直接发送到本地主机。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:772
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The above information is handled by the DNS server.  The DNS record that "
"carries mail routing information is the link:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"MX_record[mail exchanger record (MX record)].  If no MX record exists, mail "
"will be delivered directly to the host by way of its IP address."
msgstr "上述信息由 DNS 服务器处理。用于承载邮件路由信息的 DNS 记录称为 link:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/MX_record[邮件交换记录（MX 记录）]。如果不存在 MX 记录，邮件将通过 IP 地址直接投递到主机。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:774
#, fuzzy
msgid "The MX entry for `freefall.FreeBSD.org` at one time looked like this:"
msgstr "`freefall.FreeBSD.org` 的 MX 记录曾如下所示："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:781
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"freefall\t\tMX\t30\tmail.crl.net\n"
"freefall\t\tMX\t40\tagora.rdrop.com\n"
"freefall\t\tMX\t10\tfreefall.FreeBSD.org\n"
"freefall\t\tMX\t20\twho.cdrom.com\n"
msgstr ""
"freefall\t\tMX\t30\tmail.crl.net\n"
"freefall\t\tMX\t40\tagora.rdrop.com\n"
"freefall\t\tMX\t10\tfreefall.FreeBSD.org\n"
"freefall\t\tMX\t20\twho.cdrom.com\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:786
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`freefall` had many MX entries.  The lowest MX number is the host that "
"receives mail directly, if available.  If it is not accessible for some "
"reason, the next lower-numbered host will accept messages temporarily, and "
"pass it along when a lower-numbered host becomes available."
msgstr "`freefall` 有多个 MX 记录。如果可用，MX 编号最小的主机将直接接收邮件。如果由于某种原因该主机无法访问，编号次小的主机将临时接收邮件，并在编号更小的主机恢复可用后转发邮件。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:789
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Alternate MX sites should have separate Internet connections in order to be "
"most useful.  The ISP can provide this service."
msgstr "备用 MX 站点应使用独立的 Internet 连接，这样才能发挥最大作用。ISP 可以提供这项服务。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:791
#, no-wrap
msgid "Mail for a Domain"
msgstr "网域中的邮件"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:794
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When configuring an MTA for a network, any mail sent to hosts in its domain "
"should be diverted to the MTA so that users can receive their mail on the "
"master mail server."
msgstr "为网络配置 MTA 时，应将发往其域内主机的邮件转发到 MTA，以便用户在主邮件服务器上收取邮件。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:797
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To make life easiest, a user account with the same _username_ should exist "
"on both the MTA and the system with the MUA.  Use man:adduser[8] to create "
"the user accounts."
msgstr "为方便起见，MTA 和运行 MUA 的系统上应具有相同的__用户名__用户账户。使用 man:adduser[8] 创建用户账户。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:802
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In addition to adding local users to the host, there are alternative methods "
"known as virtual users.  Programs like link:https://www.cyrusimap.org/"
"[Cyrus] and link:https://www.dovecot.org/[Dovecot] can be integrated into "
"MTAs to handle users, mail storage, and also provide access via POP3 and "
"IMAP."
msgstr "除了在主机上添加本地用户之外，还有一种称为虚拟用户的替代方法。可以将 link:https://www.cyrusimap.org/[Cyrus] 和 link:https://www.dovecot.org/[Dovecot] 等程序集成到 MTA 中，以处理用户和邮件存储，并提供 POP3 和 IMAP 访问。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:806
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The MTA must be the designated mail exchanger for each workstation on the "
"network.  This is done in the DNS configuration with an MX record:"
msgstr "MTA 必须是网络中每台工作站指定的邮件交换服务器。这需要在 DNS 配置中设置 MX 记录："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:811
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"example.FreeBSD.org\tA\t204.216.27.XX\t\t; Workstation\n"
"\t\t\tMX\t10 nevdull.FreeBSD.org\t; Mailhost\n"
msgstr ""
"example.FreeBSD.org\tA\t204.216.27.XX\t\t; Workstation\n"
"\t\t\tMX\t10 nevdull.FreeBSD.org\t; Mailhost\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:815
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This will redirect mail for the workstation to the MTA no matter where the A "
"record points.  The mail is sent to the MX host."
msgstr "无论 A 记录指向何处，这都会将发往工作站的邮件转发到 MTA。邮件将发送到 MX 主机。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:818
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This must be configured on a DNS server.  If the network does not run its "
"own DNS server, talk to the ISP or DNS provider."
msgstr "这必须在 DNS 服务器上配置。如果网络没有自己的 DNS 服务器，请联系 ISP 或 DNS 提供商。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:820
#, fuzzy
msgid "The following is an example of virtual email hosting."
msgstr "以下是虚拟电子邮件托管的示例。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:822
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Consider a customer with the domain `customer1.org`, where all the mail for "
"`customer1.org` should be sent to `mail.myhost.com`."
msgstr "假设有一位客户，其域名为 `customer1.org`，所有发往 `customer1.org` 的邮件都应发送到 `mail.myhost.com`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:824
#, fuzzy
msgid "The DNS entry should look like this:"
msgstr "DNS 记录应如下所示："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:828
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "customer1.org\t\tMX\t10\tmail.myhost.com\n"
msgstr "customer1.org\t\tMX\t10\tmail.myhost.com\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:832
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"An `A` record is _not_ needed for `customer1.org` in order to only handle "
"email for that domain.  However, running `ping` against `customer1.org` will "
"not work unless an `A` record exists for it."
msgstr "对于 `customer1.org`，如果只处理该域的电子邮件，则__不__需要 `A` 记录。但是，除非存在对应的 `A` 记录，否则对 `customer1.org` 执行 `ping` 将无法正常工作。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:835
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Tell the MTA which domains and/or hostnames it should accept mail for.  "
"Either of the following will work for Sendmail:"
msgstr "告知 MTA 应为哪些域和／或主机名接收邮件。以下任一方式都适用于 Sendmail："

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:837
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Add the hosts to [.filename]#/etc/mail/local-host-names# when using the "
"`FEATURE(use_cw_file)`."
msgstr "使用 `FEATURE(use_cw_file)` 时，将主机添加到 [.filename]#/etc/mail/local-host-names#。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:838
#, fuzzy
msgid "Add a `Cwyour.host.com` line to [.filename]#/etc/sendmail.cf#."
msgstr "在 [.filename]#/etc/sendmail.cf# 中添加一行 `Cwyour.host.com`。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:840
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setting Up to Send Only"
msgstr "寄件设定"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:844
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "There are many instances where one may only want to send mail through a "
#| "relay. Some examples are:"
msgid ""
"There are many instances where one may only want to send mail through a "
"relay.  Some examples are:"
msgstr "有时，人们想通过中继发送邮件。例如："

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:846
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The computer is a desktop machine that needs to use programs such as man:"
"mail[1], using the ISP's mail relay."
msgstr "这台计算机是桌面机器，需要使用 man:mail[1] 等程序，并通过 ISP 的邮件中继发送邮件。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:847
msgid ""
"The computer is a server that does not handle mail locally, but needs to "
"pass off all mail to a relay for processing."
msgstr ""
"计算机是一个服务器，不在本地处理邮件，但需要将所有的邮件传递给中继器进行处"
"理。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:850
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"While any MTA is capable of filling this particular niche, it can be "
"difficult to properly configure a full-featured MTA just to handle "
"offloading mail.  Programs such as Sendmail and Postfix are overkill for "
"this use."
msgstr "任何 MTA 都可以胜任这一特定用途，但仅为转发邮件而正确配置功能齐全的 MTA 可能很困难。Sendmail 和 Postfix 等程序用于此用途有些大材小用。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:852
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Additionally, a typical Internet access service agreement may forbid one "
"from running a \"mail server\"."
msgstr "此外，典型的互联网接入服务协议可能禁止用户运行“邮件服务器”。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:856
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The easiest way to fulfill those needs is to use the man:dma[8] MTA included "
"in the crossref:mail[configuring-dragonfly-mail-agent, base system].  For "
"systems up to 13.2, need be to installed from ports."
msgstr "满足这些需求的最简单方法是使用 crossref:mail[configuring-dragonfly-mail-agent, 基本系统]中包含的 man:dma[8] MTA。对于 13.2 及更早版本的系统，需要从 ports 安装。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:858
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In addition to man:dma[8], third-party software can be used to achieve the "
"same, like package:mail/ssmtp[]."
msgstr "除了 man:dma[8]，也可以使用第三方软件实现相同功能，例如 package:mail/ssmtp[]。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:863
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# cd /usr/ports/mail/ssmtp\n"
"# make install replace clean\n"
msgstr "# cd /usr/ports/mail/ssmtp\n# make install replace clean\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:866
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Once installed, package:mail/ssmtp[] can be configured with [.filename]#/usr/"
"local/etc/ssmtp/ssmtp.conf#:"
msgstr "安装后，可以通过 [.filename]#/usr/local/etc/ssmtp/ssmtp.conf# 配置 package:mail/ssmtp[]："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:873
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"root=yourrealemail@example.com\n"
"mailhub=mail.example.com\n"
"rewriteDomain=example.com\n"
"hostname=_HOSTNAME_\n"
msgstr ""
"root=yourrealemail@example.com\n"
"mailhub=mail.example.com\n"
"rewriteDomain=example.com\n"
"hostname=_HOSTNAME_\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:878
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Use the real email address for `root`.  Enter the ISP's outgoing mail relay "
"in place of `mail.example.com`.  Some ISPs call this the \"outgoing mail "
"server\" or \"SMTP server\"."
msgstr "为 `root` 使用真实的电子邮件地址。将 ISP 的外发邮件中继填入 `mail.example.com` 所在的位置。有些 ISP 将其称为“外发邮件服务器”或“SMTP 服务器”。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:880
#, fuzzy
msgid "Make sure to disable Sendmail, including the outgoing mail service."
msgstr "请务必禁用 Sendmail，包括外发邮件服务。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:882
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"package:mail/ssmtp[] has some other options available. Refer to the examples "
"in [.filename]#/usr/local/etc/ssmtp# or the manual page of ssmtp for more "
"information."
msgstr "package:mail/ssmtp[] 还提供其他选项。有关详情，请参阅 [.filename]#/usr/local/etc/ssmtp# 中的示例或 ssmtp 的手册页。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:884
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Setting up ssmtp in this manner allows any software on the computer that "
"needs to send mail to function properly, while not violating the ISP's usage "
"policy or allowing the computer to be hijacked for spamming."
msgstr "以这种方式设置 ssmtp 后，计算机上任何需要发送邮件的软件都能正常工作，同时不会违反 ISP 的使用政策，也不会让计算机遭劫持而被用于发送垃圾邮件。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:886
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "SMTP Authentication"
msgid "SMTP Authentication in Sendmail"
msgstr "SMTP认证"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:890
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Configuring SMTP authentication on the MTA provides a number of benefits.  "
"SMTP authentication adds a layer of security to Sendmail, and provides "
"mobile users who switch hosts the ability to use the same MTA without the "
"need to reconfigure their mail client's settings each time."
msgstr "在 MTA 上配置 SMTP 身份验证有多项好处。SMTP 身份验证为 Sendmail 增加了一层安全保护，并使切换主机的移动用户能够使用同一个 MTA，而不必每次都重新配置邮件客户端。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:894
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Install package:security/cyrus-sasl2[] from the Ports Collection.  This port "
"supports a number of compile-time options.  For the SMTP authentication "
"method demonstrated in this example, make sure that `LOGIN` is not disabled."
msgstr ""
"从 Ports Collection 中安装 <package>security/cyrus-sasl2</package>。这个 "
"port 支持许多编译时的选项。对于本例中演示的 SMTP 验证方法，请确保 "
"<option>LOGIN</option> 选项没有被禁用。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:896
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"After installing package:security/cyrus-sasl2[], edit [.filename]#/usr/local/"
"lib/sasl2/Sendmail.conf#, or create it if it does not exist, and add the "
"following line:"
msgstr ""
"安装完<package>security/cyrus-sasl2</package>后，编辑<filename>/usr/local/"
"lib/sasl2/Sendmail.conf</filename>，如果不存在的话，也可以创建它，然后添加以"
"下行："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:900
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "pwcheck_method: saslauthd\n"
msgstr "pwcheck_method: saslauthd\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:903
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Next, install package:security/cyrus-sasl2-saslauthd[] and add execute the "
"following command:"
msgstr "接下来，安装 package:security/cyrus-sasl2-saslauthd[]，并添加执行以下命令："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:907
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "# sysrc saslauthd_enable=\"YES\"\n"
msgstr "saslauthd_enable=\"YES\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:910
msgid "Finally, start the saslauthd daemon:"
msgstr "最后启动 saslauthd ："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:914
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# service saslauthd start\n"
msgstr "# service saslauthd start\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:918
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This daemon serves as a broker for Sendmail to authenticate against the "
"FreeBSD man:passwd[5] database.  This saves the trouble of creating a new "
"set of usernames and passwords for each user that needs to use SMTP "
"authentication, and keeps the login and mail password the same."
msgstr "此守护进程充当代理，让 Sendmail 能够通过 FreeBSD man:passwd[5] 数据库进行身份验证。这样就不必为每个需要使用 SMTP 身份验证的用户另建一组用户名和密码，并且登录密码与邮件密码可以保持一致。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:920
#, fuzzy
msgid "Next, edit [.filename]#/etc/make.conf# and add the following lines:"
msgstr "接下来，编辑<filename>/etc/make.conf</filename>并添加以下行："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:925
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"SENDMAIL_CFLAGS=-I/usr/local/include/sasl -DSASL\n"
"SENDMAIL_LDADD=/usr/local/lib/libsasl2.so\n"
msgstr ""
"SENDMAIL_CFLAGS=-I/usr/local/include/sasl -DSASL\n"
"SENDMAIL_LDADD=/usr/local/lib/libsasl2.so\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:929
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"These lines provide Sendmail the proper configuration options for linking to "
"package:cyrus-sasl2[] at compile time.  Make sure that package:cyrus-sasl2[] "
"has been installed before recompiling Sendmail."
msgstr "这些行会为 Sendmail 提供正确的配置选项，以便在编译时链接到 package:cyrus-sasl2[]。重新编译 Sendmail 前，请确保已安装 package:cyrus-sasl2[]。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:931
#, fuzzy
msgid "Recompile Sendmail by executing the following commands:"
msgstr "执行以下命令重新编译 Sendmail："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:940
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# cd /usr/src/lib/libsmutil\n"
"# make cleandir && make obj && make\n"
"# cd /usr/src/lib/libsm\n"
"# make cleandir && make obj && make\n"
"# cd /usr/src/usr.sbin/sendmail\n"
"# make cleandir && make obj && make && make install\n"
msgstr "# cd /usr/src/lib/libsmutil\n# make cleandir && make obj && make\n# cd /usr/src/lib/libsm\n# make cleandir && make obj && make\n# cd /usr/src/usr.sbin/sendmail\n# make cleandir && make obj && make && make install\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:943
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This compile should not have any problems if [.filename]#/usr/src# has not "
"changed extensively and the shared libraries it needs are available."
msgstr ""
"如果<filename>/usr/src</filename>没有发生大规模修改，并且它需要的共享库可用，"
"则此编译不应有任何问题。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:946
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"After Sendmail has been compiled and reinstalled, edit [.filename]#/etc/mail/"
"freebsd.mc# or the local [.filename]#.mc#.  Many administrators choose to "
"use the output from man:hostname[1] as the name of [.filename]#.mc# for "
"uniqueness."
msgstr "Sendmail 编译并重新安装后，编辑 [.filename]#/etc/mail/freebsd.mc# 或本地的 [.filename]#.mc# 文件。许多管理员会使用 man:hostname[1] 的输出作为 [.filename]#.mc# 的名称，以确保其唯一。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:948
#, fuzzy
msgid "Add these lines:"
msgstr "添加以下几行："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:954
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"dnl set SASL options\n"
"TRUST_AUTH_MECH(`GSSAPI DIGEST-MD5 CRAM-MD5 LOGIN')dnl\n"
"define(`confAUTH_MECHANISMS', `GSSAPI DIGEST-MD5 CRAM-MD5 LOGIN')dnl\n"
msgstr ""
"dnl set SASL options\n"
"TRUST_AUTH_MECH(`GSSAPI DIGEST-MD5 CRAM-MD5 LOGIN')dnl\n"
"define(`confAUTH_MECHANISMS', `GSSAPI DIGEST-MD5 CRAM-MD5 LOGIN')dnl\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:958
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"These options configure the different methods available to Sendmail for "
"authenticating users.  To use a method other than pwcheck, refer to the "
"Sendmail documentation."
msgstr "这些选项用于配置 Sendmail 可采用的不同用户身份验证方法。若要使用 pwcheck 以外的方法，请参阅 Sendmail 文档。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:961
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Finally, run man:make[1] while in [.filename]#/etc/mail#.  That will run the "
"new [.filename]#.mc# and create a [.filename]#.cf# named either [."
"filename]#freebsd.cf# or the name used for the local [.filename]#.mc#."
msgstr "最后，在 [.filename]#/etc/mail# 中运行 man:make[1]。该命令会处理新的 [.filename]#.mc# 文件，并生成一个 [.filename]#.cf# 文件，名称为 [.filename]#freebsd.cf# 或本地 [.filename]#.mc# 文件所用的名称。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:963
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Then, run `make install restart`, which will copy the file to [."
"filename]#sendmail.cf#, and properly restart Sendmail."
msgstr "然后运行 `make install restart`，这会将文件复制为 [.filename]#sendmail.cf#，并正确重启 Sendmail。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:965
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For more information about this process, refer to [.filename]#/etc/mail/"
"Makefile#."
msgstr "有关此过程的更多信息，请参阅 [.filename]#/etc/mail/Makefile#。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:968
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To test the configuration, use a MUA to send a test message.  For further "
"investigation, set the `LogLevel` of Sendmail to `13` and watch [.filename]#/"
"var/log/maillog# for any errors."
msgstr "要测试配置，请使用 MUA 发送一封测试邮件。若要进一步排查问题，请将 Sendmail 的 `LogLevel` 设置为 `13`，并检查 [.filename]#/var/log/maillog# 中是否有错误。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/mail/_index.adoc:969
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For more information, refer to http://www.sendmail.org/~ca/email/auth."
"html[SMTP authentication]."
msgstr "有关更多信息，请参阅 link:http://www.sendmail.org/~ca/email/auth.html[SMTP 身份验证]。"

